@page
@model IndexModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Smarter Water. Better Control."; }

<div class="page-redesign home-page">
    <section id="home" class="rd-hero">
        <div class="shell rd-hero-grid">
            <div><p class="rd-kicker">Smart water control by Firmlon</p><h1>Smarter Water. <span>Better Control.</span></h1><p class="rd-hero-lede">Meet <strong>HydroSentinel</strong> &mdash; a practical smart water pump controller designed to help you monitor, protect, and manage the system around you.</p><div class="rd-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#product">Explore HydroSentinel <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a></div></div>
            <div class="rd-hero-media"><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Installation.png" alt="HydroSentinel controller beside a blue water tank and pump" width="1672" height="941" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="product" class="rd-section rd-compact" aria-labelledby="home-benefits"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-feature-strip" id="home-benefits"><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="13" height="11" rx="1.5"/><path d="M7 20h5m-2-5v5m9-8.5V20h-4.5v-8.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 0Z"/></svg></span><h3>Remote monitoring</h3><p>Review useful water-level and pump information from a connected view.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m12 3 8 3v5c0 4.8-3.4 8.2-8 10-4.6-1.8-8-5.2-8-10V6l8-3Z"/><path d="m8.5 12 2.2 2.2 4.8-5"/></svg></span><h3>Pump protection</h3><p>Make conditions that may need attention easier to notice.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3.5C9.6 7.1 6 10.9 6 14.6a6 6 0 0 0 12 0c0-3.7-3.6-7.5-6-11.1Z"/><path d="M9.5 16.5a3.2 3.2 0 0 0 3.2 2.3"/></svg></span><h3>Water-level insight</h3><p>Build a more informed picture of tank levels and water use.</p></article><article class="rd-feature"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20.5 3.5C13 3.8 7.5 6.3 6 11c-1.2 3.7 1.3 6.6 5 6.2 4.8-.5 8.3-5 9.5-13.7Z"/><path d="M3.5 21c2.5-5.1 5.8-8.8 10-11.5"/></svg></span><h3>Energy awareness</h3><p>Use system information to support more considered decisions.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-section-soft"><div class="shell rd-editorial"><figure class="rd-editorial-media"><img src="~/images/connected monitoring.jfif" alt="Industrial pump-room scene with a person reviewing information on a phone" width="2132" height="1200" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Contextual water-infrastructure imagery. This photograph does not depict connected HydroSentinel hardware.</figcaption></figure><div><p class="rd-kicker">Designed for the system around you</p><h2>Useful visibility, without losing sight of the real world.</h2><p>HydroSentinel is intended to connect the practical work of water storage and pumping with the people responsible for managing it. The experience starts with clearer information and grounded decisions.</p><div class="rd-rule-list"><div class="rd-rule"><strong>01</strong><div><h3>See the bigger picture</h3><p>Bring the tank, pump, controller, and intended user view into one understandable story.</p></div></div><div class="rd-rule"><strong>02</strong><div><h3>Stay closer to the system</h3><p>Make everyday water management easier to discuss, review, and improve.</p></div></div></div><a class="text-link" asp-page="/Product">Explore the product <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section rd-flyer-section" aria-labelledby="flyer-title">
        <div class="shell rd-flyer-layout">
            <figure class="rd-flyer-media"><img src="~/images/flyer.jpeg" alt="Firmlon HydroSentinel promotional flyer showing the controller, product messaging, plan artwork, and launch offer" width="855" height="1280" loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Promotional artwork supplied by Firmlon.</figcaption></figure>
            <div class="rd-flyer-copy"><p class="rd-kicker">A closer look at the product story</p><h2 id="flyer-title">A clear introduction for homes, businesses, and facilities.</h2><p>The supplied HydroSentinel flyer brings Firmlon&rsquo;s product story into one visual reference. It is useful promotional material for conversations with prospective customers and partners.</p>
                <div class="rd-flyer-signals" aria-label="Promotional flyer highlights"><div class="rd-flyer-signal"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19.5V5.8A1.8 1.8 0 0 1 5.8 4h10.4A1.8 1.8 0 0 1 18 5.8v13.7"/><path d="M4 19.5c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h12v2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2Z"/><path d="M8 8h6m-6 3h7"/></svg></span><div><h3>Product context</h3><p>Use the visual to start a grounded HydroSentinel conversation.</p></div></div><div class="rd-flyer-signal"><span class="rd-icon rd-icon-blue" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Promotional reference</h3><p>Review the supplied artwork alongside the current website information.</p></div></div><div class="rd-flyer-signal"><span class="rd-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 16 0"/><path d="M4 12h4m8 0h4M12 4v4"/><path d="m12 12 3-3"/></svg></span><div><h3>Next conversation</h3><p>Ask Firmlon to confirm the details that apply to your installation.</p></div></div></div>
                <div class="rd-flyer-note" role="note"><strong>Confirmation note:</strong> pricing, launch offers, contact details, capability statements, and other claims shown in the flyer are supplied promotional material and should be confirmed with Firmlon before publication or purchase decisions.</div><a class="button button-primary" asp-page="/Contact">Discuss HydroSentinel <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="how-it-works" class="rd-section" aria-labelledby="home-process-title"><div class="shell"><div class="rd-section-head"><div><p class="rd-kicker">A simple starting point</p><h2 id="home-process-title">From setup to clearer decisions.</h2></div><p>A short introduction to the intended HydroSentinel workflow. Visit How It Works for the full process view.</p></div><div class="rd-process"><article class="rd-process-card"><div class="rd-process-media rd-process-media-installation"><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Installation.png" alt="HydroSentinel controller beside a blue water tank and pump" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="rd-process-body"><span class="rd-process-number">01</span><h3>Connect the system</h3><p>Start with the controller, pump, and tank in their real installation context.</p></div></article><article class="rd-process-card"><div class="rd-process-media rd-process-media-app"><img src="~/images/Smart Water System Monitoring App.png" alt="Illustrative smartphone water monitoring interface" width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="rd-process-body"><span class="rd-process-number">02</span><h3>Set up the intended view</h3><p>Understand how an account and monitoring interface may fit into the workflow.</p></div></article><article class="rd-process-card"><div class="rd-process-media rd-process-media-dashboard"><img src="~/images/Water Management Dashboard Workspace.png" alt="Illustrative dashboard workspace for a water system, not live telemetry" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="rd-process-body"><span class="rd-process-number">03</span><h3>Review what matters</h3><p>Explore the intended dashboard experience without presenting illustrative screens as live data.</p></div></article></div><div class="rd-actions"><a class="button button-outline" asp-page="/HowItWorks">View the full process <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></div></section>
    <section class="rd-section-dark"><div class="shell rd-cta-row"><div><p class="rd-kicker">Start a conversation</p><h2>Take a clearer view of your water system.</h2><p class="rd-dark-copy">Contact Firmlon to discuss the right HydroSentinel starting point for your home, business, or facility.</p></div><a class="button button-light" asp-page="/Contact">Contact Firmlon <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a></div></section>
</div>
